/* Colour tab icons — this fork only.
 *
 * Split out of rg_logos.c so that upstream merges stop colliding here. Every
 * conflict in the 0722 sylverb merge that was not a real disagreement was in
 * that file, simply because this fork's assets and upstream's live in the same
 * translation unit. The features that already have their own files (rg_clock.c,
 * rg_alarm.c, rg_system_grid.c) produced zero conflicts in the same merge.
 *
 * Moving these is safe by construction: none of them carries LOGO_DATA, so they
 * are not in the .sdcard_logo section and cannot shift a /bios/logo.bin index.
 * The name headers stay in rg_logos.c for exactly that reason -- they DO carry
 * LOGO_DATA, and their link order is the index.
 *
 * color_icon_for_logo() is the override hook: it answers before rg_get_logo(),
 * so this fork can draw its own icon for a slot whose asset upstream owns,
 * without deleting or renumbering anything of upstream's.
 */
